        "durationFormat": "seconds",
        "helpText": "<b>A: </b>I'm the new waiter. What should I do?<br><b style=\"color: inherit;\">B: </b><span style=\"color: inherit;\">The most important thing is, give the guests menus as soon as they sit down. Remember to always be polite. Another thing to remember is, bring their food and drinks quickly. Is that clear?</span><br>",
